{"title":"Trump can't shake the Epstein story","link":"https://www.garbageday.email/p/trump-can-t-shake-the-epstein-story","date":1752853871000,"content":"<div><div><p><i>Welcome to Garbage Weekend. It’s the internet garbage you know and love, but in a format that’s easier to read while you buy tickets for next week’s Garbage Day Live. Tickets are going very very fast!!!!</i></p><div><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/8ee4ffdc-3ea2-4d08-9973-5f4e493f3662/GettyImages-681946576.jpg?t=1752850660\" /><div><span><p>(Photo by Davidoff Studios/Getty Images)</p></span></div></div><p>This week, the Trump administration <a href=\"https://www.cnn.com/2025/07/17/media/pbs-npr-trump-rescission-devastating-public-media?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=trump-can-t-shake-the-epstein-story\" target=\"_blank\">cut all funding</a> for NPR and PBS and <a href=\"https://latenighter.com/news/watch-stephen-colbert-announces-his-shows-cancellation-on-the-late-show/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=trump-can-t-shake-the-epstein-story\" target=\"_blank\">totally didn't</a> pressure CBS to cancel Stephen Colbert's show. But who needs any other artists besides the <a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/politics/trump-jeffrey-epstein-birthday-letter-we-have-certain-things-in-common-f918d796?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=trump-can-t-shake-the-epstein-story\" target=\"_blank\">Cartoonist-In-Chief</a>? President Trump's very public denial that he sent an alleged letter to Jeffrey Epstein is just the latest in a long series of failures to <a href=\"https://www.thebulwark.com/p/five-maga-factions-waging-civil-war-jeffrey-epstein?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=trump-can-t-shake-the-epstein-story\" target=\"_blank\">steer the conversation</a> away from the Epstein files. Is QAnon <a href=\"https://www.cnn.com/2025/07/16/media/qanon-epstein-trump-maga-conspiracy-theories?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=trump-can-t-shake-the-epstein-story\" target=\"_blank\">more powerful</a> than its longtime hero? Maybe they’ll get distracted by AI images of <a href=\"https://www.404media.co/the-ai-slop-niche-machine-is-here/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=trump-can-t-shake-the-epstein-story\" target=\"_blank\">literally every celebrity</a>. “Grok,<a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/information-technology/2025/07/new-grok-ai-model-surprises-experts-by-checking-elon-musks-views-before-answering/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=trump-can-t-shake-the-epstein-story\" target=\"_blank\"> is this true</a>?” It turns out it’s just checking whatever Elon Musk thinks, which has some interesting implications for both its <a href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/xai-explains-grok-mechahitler-cited-elon-musk-views-2025-7?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=trump-can-t-shake-the-epstein-story\" target=\"_blank\">MechaHitler phase</a> and its <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/706855/grok-mechahitler-xai-defense-department-contract?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=trump-can-t-shake-the-epstein-story\" target=\"_blank\">new job</a> at the Pentagon.</p><p>Oh well, here’s some fun stuff…</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/crowarmy/789337571896508416?source=share&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=trump-can-t-shake-the-epstein-story\" target=\"_blank\">MrBeast meets the Wigan Kebab guy</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/cabel.panic.com/post/3lts543djtk27?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=trump-can-t-shake-the-epstein-story\